      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_2.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/faily_full_body.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "えー？お前らのことじゃないよ。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_2.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/faily_full_body.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "猫なんていればいるほどいいでしょ。\n（なでなで）"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "精霊",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_2.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/faily_full_body.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "……♪"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/faily_full_body.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "ほら～もう前に集中する！"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_2.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/faily_full_body.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "（まったく、可愛いやつらなんだから。）"
      }
    ],
    "battle_conversation": [
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "誰かいる…。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "あのさ、あんたがこの遺跡の主？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "……。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "ねえ、この遺跡の主かって聞いてるんだけど。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "……。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "…………。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_1.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "（なんか違うっぽい。）"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_1.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "（別に案内してくれる雰囲気じゃないし、侵入者を排除する魔物かな。）"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_1.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "（こんな面倒なことしてないでさっさと会わせろよ、もう。）"
      }
    ],
    "resolution": [
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "…なるほど、魔力で構成された精霊ってわけね。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_2.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "お前らと一緒だね。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "精霊",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_2.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/faily_full_body.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "……！……！"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "ま、それなら魔力切れにしちゃえばただの布切れ…。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_1.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "（うっ…カビくさ…。）"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_1.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "（とりあえず急ごう…。この布からまだ魔力を感じるし、また復活するかも…。）"
      }
    ]
  },
  "s3d12": {
    "intro": [
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "まだつかないのかな。もう結構進んだ気がするんだけど。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "進めど進めど同じ景色で、自分がどこにいるのかすらわからなくなってきた…。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_1.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "まさかこのまま出られなくなるなんてことは…。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_1.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "か、考えないようにしよう…。"
      }
    ],
    "battle_conversation": [
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "！？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "（あの雰囲気、いかにもここの主っぽいけど…。）"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "（アレってもしかして、吸血鬼…！？）"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "やあ。よくここまで来たね。久々のお客さんだ。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_1.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "待っていたよ、フェリス・シィルベスト。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "な、なんであたしの名前を…！？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "キミも聞かなかった？この遺跡の主は島のことなら何でも知ってる情報屋ってこと。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "この島の歴史や生態は当然把握しているし、さっき森の向こうの町で起こった喧嘩で誰が勝ったのかも知っている。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_1.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "もちろん、キミが追っている魔族がこれからどこへ向かおうとしているのかもね。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_1.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_1.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "そ、そう。何でもお見通しってことね…。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_2.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_1.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "それなら話は早いんだけどさ…！"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_2.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "それで、キミはボクに何をくれるのかな？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "え？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "情報を得るためには対価を払うものでしょ？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "それに、わざわざこんな遺跡の深くにまで来るなんて、"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_1.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "人間たちが知り得ない、よっぽど貴重な情報だと思うけどな。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "い、いくら払えばいいの…？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_1.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "（どうしよう、お金なんてないよ…。）"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "ふふっ。持ち合わせの心配をしているのなら問題はないよ。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "実を言うとキミのことは前からずっと興味を持っていてね。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_1.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "キミがボクに会いに来ると知ってずっと楽しみにしていたんだ。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_1.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "な、何が言いたいの？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "キミの魔法をボクに見せてみてよ。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "……は？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "キミの魔法でボクに打ち勝つことができたなら、キミが知りたがっている情報を教えてあげる。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_1.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "どう？悪くない条件だと思うけれど。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_1.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "ちょっと、戦うって…。ここまで来るのに結構苦労したんだけど。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "……ところで、キミのその服装、この島の住人たちとは少し変わったセンスをしているね。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "よく言われるけど…。島の外じゃそれが流行ってるみたいだから。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "ここは大きい島だけれど、内地の流行や情報は少し遅れてやってくるからね。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "でも、キミみたいな若い子は内地の流行をいち早く知っておきたいんじゃない？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "……それってつまり？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_1.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "ボクなら内地で刊行されたファッション雑誌を、その日のうちに仕入れるルートを知ってる。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "吸血鬼",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/vampire_face_1.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "特別にその情報を上乗せしてあげる。"
